{"productId": "2bf699d7-7ddd-4e84-bd80-e718c3155031", "modelName": "KSG ", "modelDescription": "The KSG is Kel-Tec's first entry into the shotgun market.  The size, shape and design are similar to the currently available Kel-Tec RFB rifle, but the KSG ejects downward, instead of forward. The simple and reliable pump action feeds from either the left or right tube.  The feed side is manually selected by a lever located behind the trigger guard.  The lever can be positioned in the center detent in order to easily clear the chamber without feeding another round from either magazine.  A cross bolt style safety blocks the sear, and the pump release lever is located in front of the trigger guard. The pump includes an under Picatinny rail for the mounting of a forward grip, or a light or laser.  The included top Picatinny sight rail will accept many types of optics or iron sights.  Forward and rear sling loops are built in, and a basic sling is included.  The soft rubber butt pad helps to tame recoil.", "manufacturerName": "Kel-Tec", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "82eb52ba-f007-4603-86a8-dadbd3ed734b", "description": "Kel-Tec, KSG NR, 12 Gauge, 3\" Chamber, 18.50\" Barrel, 8 Round, Black Receiver and Barrel, Black, Fixed Bullpup Stock, Right Hand", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/abb0f395-4f35-4a1c-ad68-f197943234f0", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/33e4d103-b7b0-42ef-9bf2-38ae0e114f27"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "KSGNRBLK", "upc": "640832006735", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "571a5bce-61b6-44f6-bf8a-15fc76aa270a", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "17161f1b-348a-4696-9afc-28194a817a1f", "valueName": "Black"}, {"attributeNameId": "1754fc70-d7bc-4edb-86df-5d08daa969f8", "attributeName": "Gauge", "attributeValueId": "91c05929-b2cd-4b6a-90dd-84a1af6c4b1b", "valueName": "12 Gauge"}, {"attributeNameId": "ceb86d15-fd1e-4470-9bcf-67df60ea6815", "attribu